### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Login inválido - usuário inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naoexiste@amparo.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Login inválido - senha incorreta
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@amparo.com",
  "senha": "senhaerrada"
}

### Login válido ADMIN_MASTER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@amparo.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### Consultar usuário autenticado
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Consultar usuário autenticado sem token
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Consultar usuário autenticado com token inválido
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido

### Login inválido - email inválido
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Login inválido - senha vazia
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@amparo.com",
  "senha": ""
}